          <div class="ohco-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2h-4c0 1.1.9 2 2 2zm6-6v-5c0-3.07-1.63-5.64-4.5-6.32V4c0-.83-.67-1.5-1.5-1.5s-1.5.67-1.5 1.5v.68C7.64 5.36 6 7.92 6 11v5l-2 2v1h16v-1l-2-2z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Sens8 Massage Mechanism</h3>
          <p>The heart of every OHCO chair. The Sens8 is a 4D massage engine that uses advanced algorithms and precision motor control to create nuanced "feel" variations — changes in speed, depth, and pressure landing that mimic the instinctive adjustments of a master shiatsu therapist. This is not a simple roller with speed settings. It's a responsive system that delivers a different sensation on every pass.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ohco-pillar-card">
          <div class="ohco-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 14H6v-2h6v2zm4-4H6v-2h10v2zm0-4H6V7h10v2z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>MaxTrack (49" L-Track)</h3>
          <p>A 49-inch ultra-long massage track that follows your body's natural S-curve from the base of your neck all the way down through your glutes. MaxTrack maintains consistent roller contact through every recline position, so there are never "dead zones" where the massage loses you. This is critical for buyers who carry tension in their lower back and hips.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ohco-pillar-card">
          <div class="ohco-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v10.55c-.59-.34-1.27-.55-2-.55-2.21 0-4 1.79-4 4s1.79 4 4 4 4-1.79 4-4V7h4V3h-6z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Arms of Embrace + Easy Access Doors</h3>
          <p>The signature OHCO enclosure design — rear swinging doors that open from either side for effortless entry and exit, then lock securely when reclined. Combined with "Arms of Embrace" side panels, the chair creates a cocoon-like experience that feels private, supportive, and immersive. This is the design detail that distinguishes OHCO from open-frame competitors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ohco-pillar-card">
          <div class="ohco-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21.19 21.19L2.81 2.81 1.39 4.22l4.19 4.19c-2.11.95-3.58 3.39-3.58 5.59h2c0-2.21 1.79-4 4-4 .32 0 .63.05.94.12l1.72 1.72C10.18 12.22 10 12.59 10 13c0 .55.23 1.05.59 1.41l-3.18 3.18c-.78.78-.78 2.05 0 2.83s2.05.78 2.83 0l3.18-3.18c.36.36.86.59 1.41.59.55 0 1.05-.23 1.41-.59l.41-.41 3.13 3.13 1.41-1.38zM12 5c-1.07 0-2.05.35-2.85.93l1.46 1.46c.41-.24.88-.39 1.39-.39 1.48 0 2.68 1.2 2.68 2.68 0 .51-.15.98-.39 1.39l1.46 1.46c.58-.8.93-1.78.93-2.85 0-2.63-2.05-4.68-4.68-4.68z"/></svg></div>
