          <p>OHCO goes beyond massage with a full sensory environment: Bluetooth audio immersion so you can layer music or guided meditation, aromatherapy diffusion for scent-based relaxation, an air ionizer for fresher ambient air, and chromotherapy lighting that creates a calming visual atmosphere. Together, these transform a massage session into a complete wellness ritual.</p>
