    <div class="ohco-container">
      <div class="ohco-section-header">
        <span class="ohco-eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</span>
        <h2 class="ohco-accent-heading">Everything You Need to Know About OHCO</h2>
        <p>Genuine buyer questions, answered with substance — not filler. If you have a question not listed here, our specialists are available at {{ section.settings.phone | default: '+1 (408) 889-1188' }}.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ohco-container-narrow">
        <div class="ohco-faq-list">

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>What makes OHCO massage chairs different from other luxury brands?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>OHCO stands apart through three pillars: the proprietary Sens8 4D massage mechanism that uses advanced algorithms to mimic nuanced hand-like movements; industrial design by Ken Okuyama (Ferrari Enzo, Shinkansen bullet train) that makes each chair a genuine piece of premium furniture; and shiatsu expertise from Akira Okabayashi whose real-world techniques are digitally translated into OHCO's massage programs. Together, these create a massage experience that feels fundamentally different from standard 4D chairs — more human, more layered, and more refined.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>What is the difference between the OHCO M8 Neo and M8 Neo LE?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>Both share the same core technology platform: Sens8 4D mechanism, Movesync dual massage system, MaxTrack 49" coverage, total-body heat, full sensory immersion suite (Bluetooth, aromatherapy, chromotherapy, air ionizer), TheraElliptical calf kneading, and Easy Access Doors. The M8 Neo LE adds exclusive Limited Edition colorways like Rosso Nero, the Knead and Stretch Headrest with air-driven cervical traction, and collector-grade positioning as the ultimate expression of the OHCO lineup.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>Is OHCO a Japanese massage chair brand?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes. OHCO is deeply rooted in Japanese craftsmanship and wellness philosophy. The brand is built around two Japanese disciplines: the industrial design expertise of Ken Okuyama and the shiatsu mastery of Akira Okabayashi. The manufacturing standards, attention to material quality, and the meticulous approach to massage choreography all reflect Japanese precision and aesthetic sensibility.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>Are OHCO massage chairs worth the price?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>For buyers who value genuine massage quality over basic vibration, premium design that integrates into their home, and a consistent daily wellness routine — OHCO represents strong value. The Sens8 mechanism delivers a measurably different experience from standard 4D chairs. The build quality supports years of daily use. And the design language means the chair enhances your space rather than compromising it. If you're comparing the cost to regular professional massage sessions, most OHCO owners find the investment pays for itself within the first year of daily use.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>What is the Sens8 massage mechanism?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>The Sens8 is OHCO's proprietary 4D massage engine — the technology that defines the OHCO experience. Unlike standard rollers that apply fixed patterns at adjustable speed, the Sens8 uses advanced algorithms and precision motor control to vary depth, speed, and pressure mid-stroke. The result feels less like a machine and more like trained hands — with transitions, pressure variations, and rhythmic changes that create a genuinely human-like sensation. It's available across all three OHCO models: the R6, M8 Neo, and M8 Neo LE.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>Can I try OHCO massage chairs before buying?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>Absolutely — and we strongly recommend it. OHCO chairs are available for in-person demos at our showroom. Our specialists provide guided sessions tailored to your body, your target areas, and your priorities. This is the single most important step in choosing the right model. Call us at {{ section.settings.phone | default: '+1 (408) 889-1188' }} or visit our showroom page to schedule a visit.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>Do you offer financing for OHCO massage chairs?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>Yes. We offer financing through Affirm, which allows you to split the purchase into manageable monthly payments. Terms and rates depend on your approval — you can check during checkout or contact us for details. Many buyers use financing to acquire a higher-tier model than they initially considered.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>How long does delivery take for OHCO chairs?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>In-stock OHCO models typically ship within 5–14 business days with white-glove delivery to the room of your choice. The chair arrives fully assembled and placement-ready. Delivery timelines may vary by model and location — contact us for current availability and estimated delivery for your specific order.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>What warranty coverage is available?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>All OHCO chairs come with the manufacturer's standard warranty. We also offer extended factory-backed warranty options for additional peace of mind. Given that OHCO chairs are designed for daily use over many years, extended coverage is recommended and popular among our buyers. Contact us for specific warranty terms and pricing.</p></div></div>
          </div>

          <div class="ohco-faq-item">
            <div class="ohco-faq-q"><h3>Why choose an OHCO chair over a standard massage chair?</h3><span class="ohco-faq-toggle">+</span></div>
            <div class="ohco-faq-a"><div class="ohco-faq-a-inner"><p>Standard massage chairs deliver mechanical rolling and vibration. OHCO delivers a shiatsu-inspired experience that feels human — with nuanced pressure variations, smooth transitions, and lifelike pacing from the Sens8 engine. Beyond massage quality, OHCO chairs offer Ken Okuyama industrial design that integrates into luxury homes, multi-zone infrared heat, a complete sensory environment (audio, scent, light, air quality), and build quality that justifies daily use for years. The difference is immediately apparent in a side-by-side demo.</p></div></div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

